236
00:14:06,460 --> 00:14:08,060
Do with it what you will.

237
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:20,840
Meanwhile, on the Bowen
Islands, on the Grand Line.

238
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:25,280
Come back here, Usoppun!

239
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,700
